Z||000000||tgowens||07-04-2001||10:13 PM||||I have posted this here for those who do not read the "Club Announcements" section....<P>The time is getting close for the Western Regional Fiero Fest in San Leandro, CA - there are a few spaces left for the show field if you want to participate in the festivities! Registration can be made on the club site at [url]www.cfog.org[/i]<P>We hope to see you there!!||||reg||1
Z||000001||West Coast Fiero||07-05-2001||01:40 PM||||West Coast Fiero is having a car detail get-together here at the shop on Saturday, July 7th to prepare for the show on the 13th through the 15th. Were going to leave here in a caravan of about 15 to 20 cars early Thursday ( the 12th ) and be up there to party, I mean participate in the event.<P> Can't wait to see George agian, he's a pretty cool guy.<P>Eric<BR>West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||DisfourDan||07-05-2001||06:31 PM||||Im going to that show too.||||reg||1
Z||000003||fieroshop||07-06-2001||09:37 AM||||I wish those of you that have not made reservations for the dinner call me so that I can have the right amount of food at the banquet. I only have reserved fifty dinners and if more show up they may not get to eat that night. <BR>Those of you going please call me asap. I have to turn in final count this Saturday.<BR>866-534-8486<P>Also for those of you in the Bay Area, my shop will be open for those that want to come in and detail your Fieros. I will have all the equipment that is needed to polish and clean and touch up your car. This is free.,<P>------------------<BR> <BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
